{"assets":["/statement-assets/43ed671b3a3497589a1b05c47738927d4e0a009bcf024e566be44a104cc6d48c.png","/statement-assets/36507170015470032defee1ca9b760041f3355823d851ab7366c17058f095150.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1559","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D2. Mocha and Diana (Hard Version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is the hard version of the problem. The only difference between the two versions is the constraint on $$$n$$$. You can make hacks only if all versions of the problem are solved."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A forest is an undirected graph without cycles (not necessarily connected)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mocha and Diana are friends in Zhijiang, both of them have a forest with nodes numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, and they would like to add edges to their forests such that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After adding edges, both of their graphs are still forests. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" They add the same edges. That is, if an edge $$$(u, v)$$$ is added to Mocha's forest, then an edge $$$(u, v)$$$ is added to Diana's forest, and vice versa. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mocha and Diana want to know the maximum number of edges they can add, and which edges to add."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m_1$$$ and $$$m_2$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$, $$$0 \\le m_1, m_2 \\lt n$$$) — the number of nodes and the number of initial edges in Mocha's forest and Diana's forest."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$m_1$$$ lines contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u, v \\le n$$$, $$$u \\neq v$$$) — the edges in Mocha's forest."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$m_2$$$ lines contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u, v \\le n$$$, $$$u \\neq v$$$) — the edges in Diana's forest."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains only one integer $$$h$$$, the maximum number of edges Mocha and Diana can add."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$h$$$ lines contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u, v \\le n$$$, $$$u \\neq v$$$) — the edge you add each time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple correct answers, you can print any one of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 2 2\n1 2\n2 3\n1 2\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 3 2\n5 4\n2 1\n4 3\n4 3\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8 1 2\n1 7\n2 6\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n5 2\n2 3\n3 4\n4 7\n6 8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, we cannot add any edge."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, the initial forests are as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/43ed671b3a3497589a1b05c47738927d4e0a009bcf024e566be44a104cc6d48c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We can add an edge $$$(2, 4)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/36507170015470032defee1ca9b760041f3355823d851ab7366c17058f095150.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D2","problemCode":"1559D2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1559/problem/D2"}